amqp_dist: Erlang distribution over AMQP

Provenance

This directory is 2600Hz's erlang-amqp_dist
(https://github.com/2600hz/erlang-amqp_dist, commit b26715d73873) with one
change on top, which builds it against current OTP and rabbit_common 4.x
(GEN_SERVER_CALL_TIMEOUT is no longer defined there). It is vendored in
this tree; make/deps.mk copies it into deps/ like any other
dependency.

